<BRK/>
<TXT>Terms used in paragraph FOOD SERVICE EQUIPMENT SCHEDULE are defined as follows:</TXT><BRK/>
<OLG><BRK/>
<OLI>Sheet Pan:  Standard<MET> 450 by 650 by 25 mm</MET><ENG> 18 by 26 by 1 inch</ENG>deep pan, unless otherwise noted.</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Pan:  Standard<MET> 300 by 500 by 150 mm</MET><ENG> 12 by 20 by 6 inch</ENG> deep pan.</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Serving Tray:  Cafeteria tray<MET> 350 by 450 mm</MET><ENG> 14 by 18 inch</ENG>, unless otherwise noted.</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>115-60-1:  115-volt, 60-hertz, 1-phase electric service and connection.</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>208-60-1:  208-volt, 60-hertz, 1-phase electric service and connection.</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>208-60-3:  208-volt, 60-hertz, 3-phase electric service and connection.</OLI><BRK/></OLG>
<BRK/>
